    "title": "Gems Math Quiz - Plus",
    "description": "Gems Math Quiz - Plus is a game where you level up by solving a very simple plus quiz.\r\n\r\nPress the GAME START button to solve the plus math quiz.\r\nIf you get the correct answer, you'll get a star gem.\r\n\r\nPlease level up by collecting star gems.\r\n\r\nEverything is free in this quiz game.\r\n\r\nBe Quiz Brawler and take more quizzes than other users.\r\nBuild up your knowledge and become a Quiz Brawler to gain a sense of accomplishment.\r\n\r\nLet's get started right away.\r\n\r\nThank you for using Gems math quiz again today - plus math.\r\nYou can study math to improve your brain and have fun.\r\n\r\nPlease use it a lot.\r\n\r\nGems, take your knowledge with your luck",
